---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: May 29, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      Orlisse Living collects minimal data. When you subscribe to our newsletter, we
      collect your email address. When you leave a comment, we collect the name and
      email you provide. We also use standard analytics to understand how visitors use
      our site — this includes pages visited, time on site, and general location (country/city level only).
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use your email address solely to send the newsletter you subscribed to. We use
      analytics data to improve our content and understand what our readers find valuable.
      We never sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses minimal cookies for basic functionality and analytics. No advertising
      or tracking cookies are used. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We may use third-party services for analytics and newsletter delivery. These services
      have their own privacy policies and data handling practices. We only work with
      services that comply with GDPR and similar privacy regulations.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time using the link at the bottom of
      every email. You can request that we delete any personal data we hold about you by
      contacting us. You have the right to access, correct, or delete your data.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For any privacy-related questions, contact us at privacy@orlisseliving.com.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
